  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "Let \\(f(x)=ax^7+bx^3+cx-5,\\) where \\(a,\\) \\(b,\\) and \\(c\\) are constants. If \\(f(-7)=7,\\) then \\(f(7)\\) equals",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\(-17\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\(-7\\)"
    },
